	<section_number>38.2-4009</section_number>
	<catch_line>Inspection of books and papers</catch_line>
	<text>
		The books and papers of the burial society shall be open for examination by members or their representatives at all reasonable times.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, §§ 38-145, 38-457; 1952, c. 317, §§ 38.1-533, 38.1-555; 1986, c. 562.</history>
